Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
### Use cases
The original motivation was to emulate the look of a 3D crystal structure made by hand with paper and ink. The author (me) is not quite sure that it really matches the intended mood, but the illustrations are much more eye-catching than the physically based materials (or even path tracing) used by default in `Graphics3D`. Here are a few examples:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
